[Name] Graphene
[Summary] Thin layer of graphic data types (libgraphene)
[Description] Graphene is the lightweight graphic data-type library used by GTK4 and Mutter. Bumped to 1.10.x for the GNOME 48 stack. The ISO doesn't ship it. Build AFTER GLib 2.84 and BEFORE GTK 4.18 + Mutter. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
